    "sourceWikitext": "__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Beverage recipes|servings=10|time=15 minutes|difficulty=1\n}}{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Holiday Recipes|Holiday Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Beverages|Beverages]][[File:Perkulator2.jpg|thumb|Percolator-style coffee pot used in this recipe|387x387px]]\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 2¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Pineapple|pineapple juice]]\n* 2 cups [[Cookbook:Cranberry|cranberry]] juice\n* 1¾ cups [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Allspice|allspice]]\n* 3 sticks [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n\n== Special equipment ==\n\n* Percolator-style coffee pot\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Place the pineapple juice, cranberry juice, water, and salt in the bottom reservoir of the percolator.\n# Place the brown sugar, cloves, allspice, and cinnamon in the top compartment.\n# Heat for 10 minutes.\n# Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Southern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Christmas recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for beverages]]\n[[Category:Recipes using allspice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cranberry juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pineapple juice]]",
